  ('33040000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001', '32000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 1,
   'Read the different taxonomic categories given for mango, wheat, man and housefly. (I) Mango - Dicotyledonae (class); Anacardiaceae (family); and Sapindales (order). (II) Wheat- Poaceae (family); Poales (class); and Tritcum (genus). (III) Man - Mammalia (phylum); Hominidae (family) and Primata (order). (IV) Housefly - Insecta (class); Diptera (order) and Muscidae (family). Now, choose the incorrect combinations from the options given below.',
   'I and II only', 'II and III only', 'III and IV only', 'I and IV only', 'B', 4, 1),
  ('33040000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002', '32000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 2,
   'Assertion: Lichens are formed by symbiotic associations of autotrophs and heterotrophs. Reason: A lichen has an alga as its autotrophic component and fungus as heterotrophic component which show mutual benefit.',
   'Both assertion (A) and reason (R) are correct and reason explains the assertion', 'Both assertion (A) and reason (R) are correct and reason does not explain the assertion.', 'Both assertion (A) and reason (R) are incorrect.', 'Assertion (A) is correct and reason (R) is incorrect.', 'A', 4, 1),
  ('33040000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', '32000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 3,
