  ('33040000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012', '32000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 12,
   'Assertion (A): Mitochondria are the sites of aerobic respiration. Reason (R): They produce cellular energy in the form of glucose, hence they are called ‘power houses’ of the cell.',
