  ('33040000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018', '32000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 18,
   'Read the following statements (i) Cell cycle includes duplication of genome, synthesis of other cell constituents, division of duplicated components (ii) Interphase is the resting phase during which cells is preparing for division by undergoing both cell growth and DNA replication (iii) $\text{G}_0$ is an quiescent stage in which cells remain metabolically active (iv) During prophase, chromosome material condense to form compact mitotic chromosomes. How many statements are true?',
