   'Statement I is correct, but statement II is incorrect.', 'Statement I is incorrect.but statement II is correct.', 'Both Statement I and statement II are correct.', 'Both Statement I and statement II are incorrect.', 'C', 4, 1),
  ('33040000-0000-4000-8000-000000000029', '32000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004', 29,
